1
00:00:00,400 --> 00:00:03,530
(Leonard:)That's a biological impossibility,
and you didn't have to come.

2
00:00:03,695 --> 00:00:06,905
Oh, yes. I could have stayed behind
to watch Wolowitz hit on Penny...

3
00:00:07,073 --> 00:00:09,413
(Sheldon:)...in Russian, Arabic and Farsi.

4
00:00:09,575 --> 00:00:11,455
And why can't she get her own TV?

5
00:00:11,619 --> 00:00:13,579
(Leonard:)Come on, you know how it is
with breakups.

6
00:00:13,746 --> 00:00:16,036
(Sheldon:)No, I don't, and neither do you.

7
00:00:16,207 --> 00:00:18,247
But I... I broke up with Joyce Kim.

8
00:00:18,418 --> 00:00:21,918
(Sheldon:)You did not break up with Joyce Kim.
She defected to North Korea.

9
00:00:22,088 --> 00:00:24,628
(Leonard:)To mend her broken heart.

10
00:00:27,260 --> 00:00:29,760
(Leonard:)This situation is much less complicated.

11
00:00:29,929 --> 00:00:32,599
There's some dispute
between Penny and her ex-boyfriend...

12
00:00:32,765 --> 00:00:34,435
(Leonard:)...as to who gets custody of the TV.

13
00:00:34,600 --> 00:00:38,350
- She just wanted to avoid a scene with him.
- So we get to have a scene with him?

14
00:00:38,521 --> 00:00:41,021
(Leonard:)No, Sheldon,
there's not going to be a scene.

15
00:00:41,190 --> 00:00:42,860
(Leonard:)There's two of us and one of him.

16
00:00:43,026 --> 00:00:46,066
(Sheldon:)Leonard, the two of us
can't even carry a TV.

17
00:00:47,864 --> 00:00:50,784
(Penny(to Raj):)So you guys work with Leonard and Sheldon
at the university?

18
00:00:56,456 --> 00:00:59,026
(Penny:)I'm sorry, do you speak English?

